WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:03.766
From finished job to paid invoice.

2
00:00:04.009 --> 00:00:09.076
Your tech finishes the job and closes the ticket on their phone, with photos attached.

3
00:00:09.176 --> 00:00:14.323
Labor, materials and job details flow into the invoice. Nobody retypes them.

4
00:00:14.423 --> 00:00:17.327
Property managers get one email with a job summary,

5
00:00:17.327 --> 00:00:20.577
a photo report and a pay button for each property.

6
00:00:20.677 --> 00:00:23.863
When they pay, the job updates to paid on its own.

7
00:00:23.963 --> 00:00:27.989
And anything overdue stands out, so nothing slips.

8
00:00:28.714 --> 00:00:32.440
